# UI / Tailwind

- Tailwind utility-first; shared tokens via CSS variables when the design system is introduced.
- Customer flows: one clear job per screen (upload → quote → confirm).
- Avoid dashboard clutter on customer pages; admin may use denser tables.
- Spanish copy; short helper text under complex fields (especially derecho de petición).
- Show upload limits, price breakdown, and job status explicitly.
- Accessible forms: labels, errors tied to inputs, keyboard-friendly actions.
- Do not introduce a second CSS framework.
